    "regime_notes": "Positive 20-day IC in 2020, 2021, 2025-2029 and 2031; negative in 2022, 2023-2024 mildly, 2030 and 2032. Small cross-asset universe requires conservative interpretation. Hysteresis reduced rank turnover versus the prior 50% gate.",
